    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nMullahill is an outstanding detached five-bedroom family home extending to approximately 233 sq.m and set behind electronic gates on an impressive site of just over half an acre, this exceptional property offers spacious and elegant living in a peaceful countryside setting.\nFrom the moment you arrive, you are greeted by an impressive exterior framed by limestone and red-brick piers, leading to this very special home. Internally, the property boasts generously proportioned rooms and an abundance of natural light throughout.\nThe accommodation comprises a large entrance hallway with a striking turning staircase, and a spacious sitting room located to the left-hand side, featuring double doors opening into a generous kitchen/dining room. Off the kitchen is a delightful sunroom enjoying beautiful views over the gardens and surrounding countryside. A sizable fully fitted utility room and guest WC complete the ground floor service areas.\nBedroom one is conveniently located on the ground floor and benefits from an ensuite shower room and walk-in wardrobe.\nUpstairs, a bright and airy landing leads to two further spacious bedrooms, along with two additional generously sized double bedrooms, both of which feature an ensuite bathroom and walk-in wardrobe. A luxurious family bathroom completes the accommodation.\nOutside, the property is meticulously maintained with beautifully kept lawns, mature trees, and established laurel and copper beech hedging creating excellent privacy.\nA superb feature of this home is its B3 energy rating, along with an impressive detached garage with a first floor, fully plumbed and wired, offering excellent potential for a variety of uses.\nIdeally located close to Killeigh village and Tullamore town, the property enjoys easy access to a wide range of amenities, schools, and recreational facilities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.00m x 3.48m\nBright and spacious entrance hall featuring tiled flooring, a solid oak staircase, and convenient understairs storage.\n\nSitting Room - 5.35m x 4.36m\nGenerous and light-filled sitting room with a bay window, a feature open fireplace, and laminate flooring throughout.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 7.96m x 4.47m\nOpen-plan kitchen and dining area featuring wall and floor units, an electric hob and oven, tiled splashback and flooring, and a Stanley stove. Sliding patio doors provide access to the garden.\n\nSunroom - 5.35m x 4.36m\nSpacious sunroom with tiled flooring, dual-aspect windows, and doors opening onto the garden.\n\nUtility Room - 3.20m x 3.99m\nWell-proportioned utility room fitted with wall and floor units, with a door to the garden and a separate door leading to the WC.\n\nwc - 1.46m x 1.46m\nSpacious WC with tiled flooring and tiled splashback, comprising a WC and wash-hand basin.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.61m x 3.97m\nGenerously sized Main bedroom with a front aspect and an en-suite bathroom.\n\nEn Suite - 1.44m x 2.11m\nFully tiled en-suite comprising a WC, wash-hand basin with vanity unit, and a shower cubicle fitted with an Aqualisa shower.\n\nwalk in wardrobe - 1.46m x 1.46m\nGenerous size walk in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.71m x 3.97m\nSpacious double bedroom finished with laminate flooring and a rear-facing aspect, featuring access to a walk-in wardrobe and en-suite.\n\nEn Suite - 2.00 x 1.41\nAttractive en-suite, fully tiled and comprising a WC, wash-hand basin with vanity unit, and a shower cubicle fitted with an Aqualisa shower. It also benefits from a side window providing natural light.\n\nwalk in wardrobe - 1.79m x 1.42m\nSpacious walk in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.00m x 4.00m\nSpacious double bedroom with a rear aspect, fitted wardrobes, and an en-suite bathroom.\n\nEn Suite - 1.18m x 2.58m\nEn-suite comprising a WC, wash-hand basin (WHB), and a fully tiled shower cubicle.\n\nHotpress - 1.57m x 1.59m\nWalk-in hot press, fully shelved and providing excellent storage space.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.19m x 4.38m\nDouble bedroom with a front aspect, fitted wardrobes, and laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.97m x 3.00m\nDouble bedroom featuring laminate timber flooring and a front-facing aspect.\n\nBathroom - 2.46m x 2.60m\nFully tiled main bathroom comprising a WC, wash-hand basin with vanity unit, a corner Jacuzzi bath, and a separate shower cubicle fitted with an Aqualisa shower.\n\n"
      },
